  "description": "<p>Whenever I create a resource in Fedora 6.0.0 I get a warning in the console saying the OCFL staging directory was not deleted. For example:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><tt>WARN 16:18:35.791 (DefaultOCFLObjectSession) Failed to delete staging directory: data/fedora-home/data/staging/ce4b56ca-e592-4dde-b6d3-a02fbadc4515/19234c9b63f9d18b1726e5f499d1d5ee6206d285d5de38aa55eba84b95346e27</tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>This occurrs using the Jetty console with the latest build on the main branch (6.0.0-SNAPSHOT | Build #3555b046 (2020-07-10)).</p>",
